# Pin this repo to the public npm registry (overrides any global CFA Artifactory
# default in ~/.npmrc). The plugin's deps (@opencode-ai/plugin, zod) are public
# packages; resolving them through a private proxy bakes authenticated URLs into
# package-lock.json and breaks `npm ci` in CI (and for anyone without CFA creds).
# Keeping this here makes the lockfile portable and open-source / CI friendly.
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
